window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Fae Marked: The Found </b>– <i>A Fae Marked Novel</i></p> <p>Exiled from Etheria for the crime of simply existing—her half-witch blood a stain the Fae would never forgive—Emmalee Mayweather has spent the last ten years surviving on the fringes of both worlds. Her days are filled with herbal magic and quiet longing, her only goal to reclaim the home she lost. But loneliness is a cruel companion—one even family can’t chase away.</p> <p>That is, until she finds Braven Ellender—wounded, unconscious, and utterly without a past. Something about him stirs a fire she thought long buried, and against her better judgment, she takes him in, healing his body as her heart begins to heal in turn.</p> <p>But danger lurks in the shadows of Braven’s lost memories. The very humans who left him for dead return, and this time, they threaten more than just his life. With Emmalee and her family in their sights, Braven must make an impossible choice: protect the woman who risked everything for him or return to the world that may have tried to destroy him in the first place.</p> <p>Love brought them together, but will fate—and the truth—tear them apart?</p> <p><b>A captivating blend of magic, passion, and intrigue, </b><b><i>Fae Marked: The Found </i></b><b>delivers an unforgettable romantasy filled with sizzling tension, forbidden longing, and a love worth fighting for.</b></p>"; 
